# Published compatibility manifest for material-lab-io/gascity releases.
#
# This is the "release manifest" install.sh's usage text refers to: the exact
# gc + Dolt + bd tuple for a given gc release, with per-OS/arch SHA256
# checksums so a caller (human or rollout script) does not have to
# hand-assemble them. See gcf-aetk (AC-M1/AC-M2/AC-M3) and install.sh's own
# header for the contract this file exists to satisfy.
#
# Format: KEY=VALUE, one pin/checksum per line. Checksums are named
# <DEP>_SHA256_<OS>_<ARCH>, uppercase, matching install.sh's os/arch values
# (linux|darwin, amd64|arm64).
#
# gc's own release archive is verified against the release's own
# gascity_<version>_checksums.txt (goreleaser-generated, fetched
# automatically by install.sh) — it does not need a checksum entry here.
# GC_VERSION below exists so a reader/script has one place to see the whole
# pinned tuple at a glance.

